"entity": {
"name": "Swissquote Group Holding Ltd.",
"description": "Swissquote Group Holding Ltd. engages in the provision of online financial services. It operates under the Securities Trading and Leverage Forex (eForex) segments. The Securities Trading segment includes custody services by means of tools to trade in real time a large palette of asset classes and access a set of investment, decision-making, risk-monitoring, and margin-lending services. The eForex segment offers over-the-counter trading of foreign exchange and contracts-for-differences. The company was founded by Marc B\u00fcrki and Paolo Buzzi on August 12, 1999 and is headquartered in Gland, Switzerland.",
